  "newGroup": {
    "id": "t03-g045-r2",
    "testId": "test-03",
    "part": 4,
    "title": "Keeping track of the tool library",
    "titleZh": "借還工具也要有紀錄",
    "topic": "daily",
    "passage": "F1: Old loans had no records. Desk staff check tools and log loans. The workshop leader demonstrates power tools at noon. Skip only for exact models you've used; ignore case labels.\n\nFor courtyard returns, scan your card and wait for confirmation. A quick exit is fine. A disappearing act isn't.\n\nSunday: courtyard open, desk closed until Monday. Damaged cable? Don't return it in the courtyard. Report damage online before it's due. Hand it in when the desk reopens. Do both to avoid late fees.",
    "passageZh": "以前借工具時，我們沒有留下紀錄。現在服務台人員會檢查工具並登記借用。工作坊負責人中午會示範電動工具。只有用過同一型號，才能省略示範；別看工具盒上的標籤判斷。\n\n在中庭歸還工具時，請掃卡並等候確認。快點離開沒關係，可別上演憑空消失。\n\n星期日中庭開放，服務台星期一才重新開放。電線受損嗎？別在中庭歸還。工具到期前請上網通報損壞，等服務台重新開放時親手交還。兩項都做到，才不會被收取逾期費。",
    "audioScript": "Old loans had no records. Desk staff check tools and log loans. The workshop leader demonstrates power tools at noon. Skip only for exact models you've used; ignore case labels.\n\nFor courtyard returns, scan your card and wait for confirmation. A quick exit is fine. A disappearing act isn't.\n\nSunday: courtyard open, desk closed until Monday. Damaged cable? Don't return it in the courtyard. Report damage online before it's due. Hand it in when the desk reopens. Do both to avoid late fees.",
    "turns": [
      {
        "voice": "female",
        "speaker": "F1",
        "text": "Old loans had no records. Desk staff check tools and log loans. The workshop leader demonstrates power tools at noon. Skip only for exact models you've used; ignore case labels.\n\nFor courtyard returns, scan your card and wait for confirmation. A quick exit is fine. A disappearing act isn't.\n\nSunday: courtyard open, desk closed until Monday. Damaged cable? Don't return it in the courtyard. Report damage online before it's due. Hand it in when the desk reopens. Do both to avoid late fees."
      }
    ],
